/E (In 2025, silver surged by roughly 150%, becoming one of the most attractive assets for both retail and institutional investors. Fuelled by a dovish macroeconomic outlook and a boom in electronic manufacturing, it continued climbing aggressively into early January, reaching a record high of $115 per troy ounce.)
